 holding on to {his} skin.`),`work it out: what is wrong`),lookAgain:$(`ube`,`The bump is still there. Let's look at the clues again.`,`work it out: back to the board`),better:$(`ube`,n(r?`The tick is out. Look at {his} happy face!`:`The tick is out. Look at {him} wag!`),`better: the patient is happy`),thanks:$(t.owner,`Thank you so much! Here are 45 cents.`,`better: the owner pays`),jar:$(`ube`,`45 cents in the jar!`,`better: the coins are in`),advice:$(`ube`,`A red or puffy spot? Come back and see us.`,`better: for next time`),casebook:$(`ube`,`A new page for your casebook. A tick!`,`casebook: the page`),bye:$(`ube`,n(`Bye, {Name}! Get well soon.`),`casebook: goodbye`)},own:{lookFeel:$(`ube`,n(`Feel {his} fur gently. Look for a little bump.`),`tick-look: feel the fur`),lookFound:$(`ube`,`You found it! A small, dark bump.`,`tick-look: the bump is found`),lookCloser:$(`ube`,`Let's take a closer look.`,`tick-look: the close look`),legsAsk:$(`ube`,`Tap each little leg. Let's count them.`,`tick-look: the legs`),legsSide:$(`ube`,`4 on this side, and 4 on that side.`,`tick-look: one side done`),legsAll:$(`ube`,`4 and 4 make 8!`,`tick-look: all the legs`),legsFlat:$(`ube`,n(`It's flat, like a seed. So it hasn't been on {him} long.`),`tick-look: flat`),gloves:$(`ube`,`Gloves first. We never touch a tick with bare hands.`,`tick-out: gloves`),toolAsk:$(`ube`,`What do we take it out with?`,`tick-out: what do we use`),toolFingers:$(`ube`,n(`Not with fingers. Squeezing a tick can push germs into {him}.`),`tick-out: fingers picked`),toolJelly:$(`ube`,`Not jelly. Vets use thin tweezers.`,`tick-out: jelly picked`),toolTweezers:$(`ube`,`Thin tweezers, just right!`,`tick-out: tweezers picked`),tweezersAsk:$(`ube`,`Hold the tweezers close to the skin.`,`tick-out: the tweezers to the skin`),pullAsk:$(`ube`,`Now pull straight out, slow and steady.`,`tick-out: pull`),pullLong:$(`ube`,`It can take a minute or two.`,`tick-out: while she pulls`),pullKeep:$(`ube`,`Keep going.`,`tick-out: keep going`),pullSlow:$(`ube`,`Slowly. Don't twist it, and don't yank it.`,`tick-out: too fast`),pullOut:$(`ube`,`It let go! The whole tick is out.`,`tick-out: out`),jarAsk:$(`ube`,`Put it in the little jar, and close the lid.`,`tick-out: the jar`),jarName:$(`ube`,n(`The jar gets {his} name.`),`tick-out: the jar is closed`),jarKind:$(`ube`,`Then we can find out what kind it is.`,`tick-out: the jar is closed`),washAsk:$(`ube`,`Now wash the spot with soap and water.`,`tick-out: wash the spot`),washDone:$(`ube`,`All clean. We wash our hands after, too.`,`tick-out: washed`),boxIntro:$(`ube`,n(`Medicine helps keep ticks away. Which box is for {him}?`),`tick-medicine: which box`),boxOn:$(`ube`,n(`I'll put it on the back of {his} neck.`),`tick-medicine: Ube Ube puts it on`),checkTicks:$(`ube`,n(r?`Check {him} for ticks each time {he} comes in.`:`Check {him} for ticks every day. Stay out of tall grass.`),`tick-medicine: for next time`),...r?{boxDog:$(`ube`,`Stop! That is for dogs. It can make a cat very sick.`,`tick-medicine: the dog box, stopped`),boxDogWhy:$(`ube`,`A cat's body can't break it down.`,`tick-medicine: why not`),boxDogNever:$(`ube`,`Never put dog flea and tick medicine on a cat.`,`tick-medicine: the rule`),boxHowMuch:$(`ube`,n(`I know how much {he} needs.`),`tick-medicine: done`)}:{boxCat:$(`ube`,`That box is for cats. Look at the picture.`,`tick-medicine: the cat box picked`),boxMonth:$(`ube`,n(`{He} gets this once a month.`),`tick-medicine: once a month`),calAsk:$(`ube`,`When is the next one? Put a paw sticker on the calendar.`,`tick-medicine: the calendar`),calDone:$(`ube`,`Next month, on the same day!`,`tick-medicine: the sticker is on`)}},facts:{tick:{side:e.side??`left`},monthly:!r}}}},mie={id:`too-round`,source:`vet/design/cases/too-round.md`,sides:[null],canonical:{patient:`sunny`,temperatureF:101.5,temperatureC:38.6},groups:{cat:{sources:[`vet/design/cases/too-round.md`,`https://www.petobesityprevention.org/catbcs`,`https://www.merckvetmanual.com/manag