} nail`}},lines:{story:[$(t.owner,n(`Hello! This is {Name}. {He} yelped running on the path.`),`arrive: the story`),$(t.owner,n(`Now {he} holds up {his} front paw. There is blood.`),`arrive: the story`)],welcome:$(`ube`,n(`Hi, {Name}! Come on in.`),`arrive: welcome`),weighHop:$(`ube`,n(`Hop up, {Name}!`),`weigh: onto the scale`),rightWhy:$(`ube`,`It came on fast. And the cracked nail is right there!`,`work it out: the right cause`),rightName:$(`ube`,n(`{His} nail cracked, like when you rip a fingernail.`),`work it out: what is wrong`),lookAgain:$(`ube`,n(`{His} toe is still sore. Let's look at the clues again.`),`work it out: back to the board`),better:$(`ube`,n(`{His} paw is all wrapped up. Look at {his} wag!`),`better: the patient is happy`),thanks:$(t.owner,`Thank you so much! Here are 65 cents.`,`better: the owner pays`),jar:$(`ube`,`65 cents in the jar!`,`better: the coins are in`),advice:$(`ube`,n(`Keep {his} bandage clean and dry. Come back to change it.`),`better: for next time`),casebook:$(`ube`,`A new page for your casebook. A torn nail!`,`casebook: the page`),bye:$(`ube`,n(`Bye, {Name}! Get well soon.`),`casebook: goodbye`)},own:{pawLeg:$(`ube`,n(`First, feel {his} leg. Touch {his} elbow, then {his} wrist. Gently.`),`paw: feel the leg`),pawElbow:$(`ube`,n(`{His} elbow is not swollen.`),`paw: the elbow is fine`),pawWrist:$(`ube`,n(`{His} wrist is not swollen, either.`),`paw: the wrist is fine`),pawToes:$(`ube`,`Now lift each toe, gently, and look.`,`paw: lift each toe`),pawToeFine:$(`ube`,`This toe is fine.`,`paw: a toe is fine`),pawFound:$(`ube`,`There! This nail is cracked and hanging.`,`paw: the cracked nail is found`),nailHug:$(`ube`,n(`Even a kind dog may nip when sore. So I hug {him} gently.`),`nail: the hug`),nailGauze:$(`ube`,n(`This soft white pad is gauze. Press it on {his} toe, for five minutes.`),`nail: the gauze, shown`),nailEarly:$(`ube`,n(`{His} toe is still bleeding. Press a bit longer.`),`nail: let go too soon`),nailStopped:$(`ube`,`Five m